Verse 1:
[Eb]We give [Ab/Eb]this child [Eb]toYou,
[Eb]Our precious [Ab]gift [Gm]of love.
[Cm]Help us [Bb]to [Bb7/Ab]lead [Eb/G]each step [Bb/F]aright
[Ab/C]With [Eb/Bb]guidance [Bb7]froma bove.

Verse 2:
[Eb]O bless each [Ab/Eb]child of [Eb]Yours,
[Eb]And grant [Ab]when they [Gm]are grown,
[Cm]They will [Bb]have [Bb7/Ab]learned [Eb/G]to love [Bb/F]Your [Eb]way,
[Ab/C]And [Eb/Bb]choose [Ab]it [Bb7]for their own.

Verse 3:
[Eb]We give ourselves [Ab/Eb]to [Eb]You,
[Eb]And may [Ab]Your Spirit [Gm]fill
[Cm]Our hearts [Bb]and [Bb7/Ab]home, [Eb/G]that all [Bb/F]we [Eb]do
[Ab/C]Be [Eb/Bb]subject [Bb7]to Your will.
